post.description:
Track a client-side event for analytics.

    Events are stored with optional user association for authenticated users.

    Request body:
    ```json
    {
        "type": "event_type",
        "payload": {"custom": "data"}
    }
    ```

Track multiple client-side events in a single request.

    Request body:
    ```json
    {
        "events": [
            {"type": "event1", "payload": {}},
            {"type": "event2", "payload": {}}
        ]
    }
    ```
